					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "MOVE\n\nThe Move node allows for moving a shape or slice over the X and Y axis. It is like the Transform node, but less taxing on your GPU.\n\nNote that Slices are converted to shapes in the process.\n\nIn this patch we use the Move node to modulate the X position of the Circle shape."
					}
